                    {
                        "sense_id": "7ce50934-b06f-34da-87c9-cbc600d3aa22",
                        "entry_id": "04925e14-c4b3-3f4c-b361-65ce60338ffa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A male given name from Latin"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "18db7784-2296-4037-9de5-e33010a80697",
                                "sense_id": "7ce50934-b06f-34da-87c9-cbc600d3aa22",
                                "text": "Q. Q.] ‘the two Quinti.’ Quintus, the brother of Cicero, and his son Quintus. […] utinam mederi] ‘would that my nearest and dearest had chosen to relieve my sufferings, rather than to aggravate them’; he refers to the Quinti and Terentia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c000f302-2dff-4f96-9d2e-bb536bf56508",
                                "sense_id": "7ce50934-b06f-34da-87c9-cbc600d3aa22",
                                "text": "“Quintus, I want a word with you,” said the other Quintus, for there are two Quinti."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "852b09dd-5c4e-43c6-8fa5-607c95b5ba16",
                                "sense_id": "7ce50934-b06f-34da-87c9-cbc600d3aa22",
                                "text": "Cicero’s preoccupation with the slander spread by the two Quinti about him at a dangerous time would in any case have led him to focus less on everyday family ructions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "02b08878-f60c-4966-8c79-cc77a441948d",
                                "sense_id": "7ce50934-b06f-34da-87c9-cbc600d3aa22",
                                "text": "Neither of the Quintuses moved, too enthralled to care what Gnaeus Pompey did to the family tyrant."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d61d9d4-ab52-300d-910c-f080235da316",
